WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:04.359
We've all heard that sales is the life-blood
of any business, and great businesses who

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:08.880
have their top-line revenue constantly growing
do these three things better than their competitors do.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:09.880
Here's what it is.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.860
Step number 1: they have the best finders.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.320
Number 2: they have closers.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:15.800
Number 3: they have developers.

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.720
Let me tell you what each one of their roles
is.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.660
A finder is somebody who knows how to get
an interested buyer, a prospect, a lead, a

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.220
customer that wants to buy from you.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:28.420
They're very good at generating interest.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:33.060
The closer is somebody who has the top 20
F.A.Q.s of any product being sold.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:37.140
So they know it, they know how to overcome
that objection, they know how to address that

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.700
concern, they know how to make sure the customer
feels comfortable buying the product.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:41.700
And then you have the developer.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:46.740
A developer is somebody who goes back to already
existing customers and says, "are you happy

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:47.480
with us?

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.960
How else can we be of service?

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:52.320
what else can we do for you? is there any
other thing you need with us?"

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:58.300
All 3 matter because this brings more sales,
this consistently closes, and this keeps an

00:00:58.309 --> 00:01:00.410
opening for a new flow of customers wanting
to buy.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:04.030
Now here's the thing: out of all the three,
do you know which one matters the most?

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:05.059
Out of all the three?

00:01:05.059 --> 00:01:09.840
Because a lot of closers say, "I'm the best
closer you know," but they only make $70,000/year.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:10.760
You know why?

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.600
Because they're not the best finders.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:16.960
Without finders, there are no closers, there
are no developers.

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:23.220
So always look for many finders who know how
to generate new customers for your business.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:28.039
By the way, if you know a great finder out
there, tag them in the video or share this

00:01:28.039 --> 00:01:28.539
with them.

